# Project rules

All project instructions live in `AGENTS.md`, the shared source of truth for every AI tool. Read it first,
then only the `rules/*.md` documents its routing table names for the task. Do not add project rules here;
change `AGENTS.md` (and `rules/17-ai-agent-prompts.md`) instead.

@AGENTS.md
@rules/00-non-negotiables.md

Before saying a task is done, run the completion gate from `AGENTS.md` after the last edit:
`pnpm run lint`, `pnpm run typecheck`, `pnpm run test`, `pnpm exec expo install --check`. Never suppress a rule, cast, or edit
the gate's configuration to get green.
